So we have a deleted scene.
所以我们有一个删减片段。

543
00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.840
And I remember shooting it.
我记得当时拍摄的情景。

544
00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:10.940
What Pam says when she picks up the pencil is she says, oh my gosh, this is the pencil I threw at you during mini golf.
Pam 拿起铅笔时说的是，天哪，这就是我在迷你高尔夫球场扔向你的那支铅笔。

545
00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:13.140
What?
什么？

546
00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.940
When did Jim and Pam go play mini golf?
Jim 和 Pam 什么时候去打过迷你高尔夫？

547
00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:19.940
Maybe the whole office went and played mini golf.
也许是整个办公室的人一起去打的迷你高尔夫。

548
00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:26.840
That seems like something Michael Scott would be like, we're going to play mini golf and we're going to raise money for my neighbors.
这听起来像是 Michael Scott 会做的事，他会说，我们要去打迷你高尔夫，还要为我的邻居们筹款。

549
00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:28.240
Yeah.
是啊。

550
00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:28.680
Whatever.
随便吧。

551
00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:38.600
That's all I can think of is that there was some office outing where they went and played mini golf and I guess Pam got all feisty and threw a pencil at him and he saved it.
我能想到的只有那次办公室团建，他们去玩了迷你高尔夫，我猜帕姆当时特别好斗，朝他扔了一支铅笔，结果被他接住了。

552
00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:40.000
So that's where the pencil is.
所以那支铅笔就在那儿。

553
00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:48.720
And then, of course, he puts a card in the box and he says, because Christmas time is the time to tell people how you feel.
然后，当然了，他在盒子里放了一张卡片，他说，因为圣诞节是向人们表达心意的时刻。

554
00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:49.800
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

555
00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:50.960
That's so loaded.
那话里有话啊。

556
00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.420
I have PPC next.
接下来是派对筹备委员会（PPC）。

557
00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:54.320
Let's hit some PPC.
我们来聊聊PPC吧。

558
00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.580
The Party Planning Committee.
派对筹备委员会。

