00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:59.560
You know, Mike Schur also wrote the PPC in The Alliance.
你知道吗，迈克·舒尔也写了《联盟》那一集里的PPC剧情。

560
00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:01.240
I think he likes the PPC.
我觉得他很喜欢PPC。

561
