a montage with a song.
那种配乐的蒙太奇。

1688
01:09:51.190 --> 01:09:51.450
No.
没错。

1689
01:09:51.690 --> 01:09:54.430
You had montages were set to talking heads.
我们的蒙太奇都是配合采访镜头的。

1690
01:09:54.430 --> 01:09:58.270
And we have had a montage with a song, but it's like the song playing in the car.
我们确实有过配乐的蒙太奇，但那是因为车里在放那首歌。

1691
01:09:58.630 --> 01:09:59.070
Sure.
当然。

1692
01:09:59.370 --> 01:10:00.110
Something like that.
类似那样的情况。

1693
01:10:00.110 --> 01:10:02.930
It has to be sound that is, what do they call that?
必须是那种，他们管那叫什么来着？

1694
01:10:03.050 --> 01:10:04.250
Like a live sound.
就像现场音。

1695
01:10:04.270 --> 01:10:05.030
Active, a live sound.
主动音，现场音。

1696
01:10:05.030 --> 01:10:05.270
Yeah.
对。

1697
01:10:05.370 --> 01:10:05.970
Something like that.
类似那样。

1698
01:10:06.050 --> 01:10:06.650
Active sound.
现场音。

1699
01:10:06.870 --> 01:10:07.310
Yeah.
是啊。

1700
01:10:07.510 --> 01:10:12.730
Before we get to the final scenes of the show, I just wanted to point out two lines that fans
在进入剧集的最后几幕之前，我只想指出两句粉丝提到的台词。

1701
01:10:12.730 --> 01:10:16.430
have quoted as some of their favorite lines ever in this episode.
在本集中被引用为他们有史以来最喜欢的台词。

1702
01:10:16.550 --> 01:10:17.010
Oh, yes.
噢，没错。

1703
