1706
01:10:21.890 --> 01:10:22.330
Yes.
没错。

1707
01:10:22.330 --> 01:10:28.290
And another fan favorite is, Yankee Swap is like Machiavelli meets Christmas.
另一句粉丝最爱是，白象交换礼物就像马基雅维利遇上了圣诞节。

1708
01:10:28.770 --> 01:10:33.870
And I really do want you guys to check out the DVD deleted scenes from this episode.
我真的希望你们去看看这一集的DVD删减片段。

